{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21857","headline":"卢十九子蒙吟卢七员外洛川怀古六韵命余和 · 元稹","name":"卢十九子蒙吟卢七员外洛川怀古六韵命余和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道卢明府，闲行咏洛神。\n浪圆疑靥笑，波鬬忆眉嚬。\n蹀躞桥头马，空蒙水上尘。\n草芽犹犯雪，冰岸欲消春。\n寓目终无限，通辞未有因。\n子蒙将此曲，吟似独眠人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}